[{"t":"Evaluate: ∫{(logx−1)/(1+(logx)²)}²dx.","s":"Method1: by cross checking the optionsConsider f(x)=x/((logx)²+1)∴  f^′(x)=(1+(log x)²−(2 xlog x)/x)/((1+(log x)²)²)\n∴ f^′(x)=(1+(log x)²−2log x)/((1+log²x)²)=((log x−1)/((1+log x)²))²\n∴ ∫(((log x−1)²)/(1+(log x)²))dx=∫f^′(x)dx=f(x)+C\n∴ ∫((logx−1)/(1+(log x)²))²dx=x/(1+(log x)²)+C\nHence option 3 is the correct answer and we can check the other choices by the similar argument.\nAlternate solution\n∫{(log (x)−1)/(1+(log x)²)}²dx\nPut log(x)=t⇒x=eᵗ⇒dx=eᵗdt\n=∫eᵗ{((t−1)²)/((t²+1)²)}dt\n∫eᵗ{(t²+1−2t)/((t²+1)²)}dt\n=∫eᵗ{1/(t²+1)+((−2t)/((t²+1)²))}dt\n=eᵗ/(t²+1)+C [∵ ∫eˣ(f(x)+f^′(x))dx=eˣf(x)+C]\n=x/((log x)²+1)","d":"M","p":"Integration by Substitution","k":"Test 1 (Topic Test)","o":["x/(x²+2)+C","(log x)/((log x)²+1)+C","x/((log x)²+1)+C","xeˣ/(1+x²)+C"],"a":2,"i":"M25-0000"},{"t":"∫dx/((x+√(x(1+x)))²)","s":"I=∫dx/([x+√(x(1+x))]²)\n=∫1/(x²(1+√(1+1/x))²)dx\nput 1+1/x=t²\n−1/x²dx=2tdt\nor I=∫(−2t dt)/((a+t)²)=−∫2t/(t²+2t+1)dt\n=−[∫(2t +2)/(t²+2t+1)dt−∫2/(t²+2t+1)dt]\n=−[ln(t+1)²−2 ∫1/((t+1)²)dt]\n=−[2ln(t+1)+ 2/(t+1)−c]\nor I=−2ln(1+√(1+1/x))−2/(1+√(1+1/x))+c","d":"M","p":"Integration by Substitution","k":"Test 1 (Topic Test)","o":["−2ln(1+√(1+1/x))−2/(1+√(1+1/x))+c","−2ln(1−√(1+1/x))+2/(1+√(1+1/x))+c","−2ln(1+√(1−1/x))+2/(1+√(1−1/x))+c","−2ln(1−√(1+1/x))+2/(1−√(1+1/x))+c"],"a":0,"i":"M25-0001"},{"t":"∫dx/((x−1)√(x²−1)) is equal to","s":"Let I=∫dx/((x−1)√(x²−1)) Put x−1=1/t⇒x=1+1/t Then,  dx=(−1)/t²dt [ ∴ I=∫(−1/t²dt)/(1/t√((1+1/t)²−1))=−∫dt/(t√(1+1/t²+2/t−1)); =−∫dt/(t√((1+2t)/t²))=−∫dt/(√(1+2t)); =−∫(1+2t)^(−1/2)dt; =−((1+2t)^(−1/2+1))/(−1/2+1)×1/2; =−√(1+2t)+C; =−√(1+2(1/(x−1)))+C=−√((x−1+2)/(x−1))+C] Thus, I=−√((x+1)/(x−1))+C","d":"M","p":"Integration by Substitution","k":"Test 1 (Topic Test)","o":["−√((x−1)/(x+1))+C","√((x−1)/(x²+1))+C","−√((x+1)/(x−1))+C","√((x²+1)/(x−1))+C"],"a":2,"i":"M25-0002"},{"t":"∫e^(sinθ)(logsinθ+cosec²θ)cosθdθ is equal to","s":"Let, I=∫e^(sinθ)(logsinθ)cosθdθ+∫e^(sinθ)(cosec²θ)cosθdθPut, sinθ=t⇒cosθdθ=dt∴ I=∫eᵗlogtdt+∫eᵗt⁻²dt=logteᵗ−∫eᵗ/tdt+eᵗt⁻¹/(−1)−∫eᵗt⁻¹/(−1)dt=eᵗ(logt−1/t)+c=e^(sinθ)(logsinθ−cosecθ)+c, where c is constant of integration.","d":"M","p":"Integration by Substitution","k":"Test 1 (Topic Test)","o":["∫e^(sinθ)[logsinθ+cosec²θ]+c","e^(sinθ)[logsinθ+cosec θ]+c","e^(sinθ)[logsinθ−cosecθ]+c","e^(sinθ)[logsinθ−cosec²θ]+c"],"a":2,"i":"M25-0003"},{"t":"∫dx/(7+5cosx) is equal to","s":"Let [I =∫dx/(7+5cosx); =∫dx/(7(cos²x/2+sin²x/2)+5(cos²x/2−sin²x/2)); =∫dx/(12cos²x/2+2sin²x/2); =1/2∫(sec²x/2)/(6+tan²x/2)dx]\nLet tanx/2=z\n[ ⇒1/2sec²x/2dx=dz; ∴ I=∫dz/(6+z²); =1/√6tan⁻¹z/√6+c; =1/√6tan⁻¹(1/√6tanx/2)+c; ]","d":"H","p":"Integration by Substitution","k":"Test 1 (Topic Test)","o":["1/√3tan⁻¹(1/√3tanx/2)+c","1/√6tan⁻¹(1/√6tanx/2)+c","1/7tan⁻¹(tanx/2)+c","1/4tan⁻¹(tanx/2)+c"],"a":1,"i":"M25-0004"},{"t":"∫(1+x+√(x+x²))/(√x+√(1+x))dx is equal to","s":"∫(1+x+√(x+x²))/(√x+√(1+x))dx =∫((1+x)+√(x(1+x)))/(√x+√(1+x))dx =∫(√(1+x)(√(1+x)+√x))/(√x+√(1+x))dx =∫√(1+x)dx=((1+x)^(3/2))/(3/2)+C =2/3(1+x)^(3/2)+C","d":"M","p":"Integration by Substitution","k":"Test 1 (Topic Test)","o":["1/2√(1+x)+C","2/3(1+x)^(3/2)+C","√(1+x)+C","2(1+x)^(3/2)+C"],"a":1,"i":"M25-0005"},{"t":"∫dx/(√(x−x²)) is equal to","s":"Let [I =∫dx/(√(x−x²)); =∫1/√x×dx/(√(1−x))] Put  √x=sinθ [⇒ 1/2√xdx =cosθdθ; ∴ I =∫2cosθdθ/(√(1−sin²θ)); =∫2cosθ/cosθdθ; =∫2dθ=2θ+C; =2sin⁻¹√x+C]","d":"H","p":"Integration by Substitution","k":"Test 1 (Topic Test)","o":["2sin⁻¹√x+C","2sin⁻¹x+C","2xsin⁻¹x+C","sin⁻¹√x+C"],"a":0,"i":"M25-0006"},{"t":"∫x²/((9−x²)^(3/2)) dx=","s":"Put x=3 sinθ ⇒dx=3cosθ dθ,Therefore∫x²/((9−x²)^(3/2)) dx= ∫9sin²θ/((9−9sin²θ)^(3/2) . 3cosθ) dθ= ∫27sin²θcosθ/27cos³θ dθ= ∫tan²θ dθ= ∫(sec²θ−1)dθ=tanθ−θ+c=tan{sin⁻¹(x/3)}−sin⁻¹(x/3)+c=tan⁻¹((x/3)/(√(1−(x²/9))))−sin⁻¹(x/3)+ c=x/(√(9−x²))−sin⁻¹(x/3)+c .","d":"M","p":"Integration by Substitution","k":"Test 1 (Topic Test)","o":["x/(√(9−x²))−sin⁻¹x/3+c","x/(√(9−x²))+sin⁻¹x/3+c","sin⁻¹x/3−x/(√(9−x²))+c","None of these"],"a":0,"i":"M25-0007"},{"t":"∫tan³2xsec2xdx=","s":"Let  I=∫tan³2x⋅sec2xdx\n=∫tan²2x⋅sec2x⋅tan2xdx\n=∫(sec²2x−1)sec2x⋅tan2xdx\nPut sec 2x=t\n2sec2x⋅tan2xdx=dt\nNow sec2x⋅tan2xdx=dt/2\nI=1/2∫(t²−1)dt\n=1/2[t³/3−t]+C\n=1/2[sec³2x/3−sec2x]+C=1/6[sec³2x−3sec2x]+C","d":"M","p":"Integration by Substitution","k":"Test 1 (Topic Test)","o":["sec³2x+3sec2x","1/6[sec³2x−3sec2x]","sec³2x−3sec2x","None of these"],"a":1,"i":"M25-0008"},{"t":"∫dx/((x+100)√(x+99))=f(x)+c. FInd the value of f(x)","s":"Let $\n$\nPut √(x+99)=t⇒1/(√(x+99))dx=2dt\n$\n$\nFrom Eqs. (i)\n$\n$","d":"H","p":"Integration by Substitution","k":"Test 1 (Topic Test)","o":["2(x+100)^(1/2)","3(x+100)^(1/2)","2tan⁻¹(√(x+99))","2tan⁻¹(√(x+100))"],"a":2,"i":"M25-0009"},{"t":"∫(√(5+x²))/x⁴dx is equal to","s":"Let I=∫(√(5+x²))/x⁴dx\nput x=√5tanθ\n⇒∫(√(5+x²))/x⁴dx=∫(√(5+5tan²θ))/((√5tanθ)⁴)√5⋅sec²θdθ\n=∫(√(5(1+tan²θ)))/((5)²tan⁴θ)√5⋅sec²θdθ\n=∫√5sec²θ/25tan⁴θ√5sec²θdθ\n=∫√5secθ√5sec²θdθ/25tan⁴θ=1/5∫cosθ/sin⁴θdθ\nPut sinθ=t⇒cosθdθ=dt\n=1/5∫dt/t⁴=(−1)/151/t³+C=(−1)/15[1/sin³θ]+C\n=(−1)/15[cosec²θ⋅cosecθ]+C\n=(−1)/15[(1+cot²θ)⋅√(1+cot²θ)]+C\n=(−1)/15[(1+tan²θ)/tan²θ×√((1+tan²θ)/tan²θ)]+C\n=−1/15[(1+tan²θ)/tan²θ]^(3/2)+C=−1/15[(1+x²/5)/(x²/5)]^(3/2)+C\n=(−1)/15[1+5/x²]^(3/2)+C .","d":"M","p":"Integration by Substitution","k":"Test 1 (Topic Test)","o":["1/15(1+5/x²)^(3/2)+C","(−1)/15(1+1/x²)^(3/2)+C","(−1)/15(1+5/x²)^(3/2)+C","1/15(1+1/x²)^(3/2)+C"],"a":2,"i":"M25-0010"},{"t":"∫√x/(1+∜x³)dx is equal to","s":"[ Put x=z⁴⇒dx=4z³dz; ∴∫√x/(1+∜x³)dx=∫(z²⋅4z³)/(1+z³)dz=4∫(z³⋅z²)/(z³+1)dz; =4/3∫(y−1)/ydy; [ Putting z³+1=y⇒z²dz=1/3dy; =4/3(y−logy)+C; =4/3[1+x^(3/4)−log(1+x^(3/4))]+C]","d":"M","p":"Integration by Substitution","k":"Test 1 (Topic Test)","o":["4/3[1+x^(3/4)+log(1+x^(3/4))]+C","4/3[1+x^(3/4)−log(1+x^(3/4))]+C","4/3[1−x^(3/4)+log(1+x^(3/4))]+C","None of these"],"a":1,"i":"M25-0011"},{"t":"∫(x²−1)/(x√(x⁴+3x²+1))dx is equal to","s":"∫(x²−1)/(x√(x⁴+3x²+1))dx=∫(x²−1)/(x²√(x²+3+1/x²))dx\n=∫(1−1/x²)/(√((x+1/x)²+1))dx=∫dz/(√(z²+1))\n[ Putting x+1/x=z⇒(1−1/x²)dx=dz\n=log|z+√(z²+1)|+C\n=log|x+1/x+√(x²+1/x²+3)|+C !","d":"H","p":"Integration by Substitution","k":"Test 1 (Topic Test)","o":["log|x+1/x+√(x²+1/x²+3)|+C","log|x−1/x+√(x²+1/x²−3)|+C","log|x+√(x²+3)|+C","None of these"],"a":0,"i":"M25-0012"},{"t":"∫((1+x)eˣ)/(cot(xeˣ))dx is equal to","s":"Let I=∫((1+x)eˣ)/(cot(xeˣ))dx\nPut xeˣ=t⇒(xeˣ+eˣ)dx=dt\n⇒eˣ(x+1)dx=dt\n∴I=∫dt/(cot(t))=log|sect|+C\n=log|sec(xeˣ)|+C !","d":"M","p":"Integration by Substitution","k":"Test 1 (Topic Test)","o":["log|cos(xeˣ)|+C","log|cot(xeˣ)|+C","log|sec(xe⁻ˣ)|+C","log|sec(xeˣ)|+C"],"a":3,"i":"M25-0013"},{"t":"∫(x+1/x)ⁿ⁺⁵((x²−1)/x²)dx is equal to","s":"I=∫(x+1/x)ⁿ⁺⁵((x²−1)/x²)dx\nPut x+1/x=t⇒(1−1/x²)dx=dt\n⇒((x²−1)/x²)dx=dt\n∴I=∫tⁿ⁺⁵dt=(tⁿ⁺⁶)/(n+6)+c=((x+1/x)ⁿ⁺⁶)/(n+6)+c","d":"E","p":"Integration by Substitution","k":"Test 1 (Topic Test)","o":["((x+1/x)ⁿ⁺⁶)/(n+6)+c","[(x²+1)/x²]ⁿ⁺⁶(n+6)+c","[x/(x²+1)]ⁿ⁺⁶(n+6)+c","none of these"],"a":0,"i":"M25-0014"},{"t":"What is ∫secⁿxtanxdx equal to ?","s":"Let I=∫secⁿxtanxdx.\nPut, secx=t⇒secxtanxdx=dt\n∴ I=∫tⁿ⋅dt/t\n∫tⁿ⁻¹dt=tⁿ/n+c=secⁿx/n+c\nwhere ’ c ’ is a constant of integration","d":"M","p":"Integration by Substitution","k":"Test 1 (Topic Test)","o":["secⁿx/n+c","secⁿ⁻¹x/(n−1)+c","tanⁿx/n+c","tanⁿ⁻¹x/(n−1)+c\nWhere ’ c ’ is a constant of integration."],"a":0,"i":"M25-0015"},{"t":"If ∫sin³xcos⁵xdx\n=Asin⁴x+Bsin⁶x+Csin⁸x+D Then","s":"I=∫sin³x⋅cos⁵xdx\nPut sinx=t⇒cosxdx=dt\nI=∫sin³x⋅cos⁴x⋅cosxdx=∫t³(1−t²)²dt\n=∫(t³−2t⁵+t⁷)dt=1/4t⁴−2/6t⁶+1/8t⁸+D\n=1/4sin⁴x−1/3sin⁶x+1/8sin⁸x+D","d":"M","p":"Integration by Substitution","k":"Test 1 (Topic Test)","o":["A=1/4, B=−1/3,C=1/8,D∈R","A=1/8, B=1/4,C=1/3,D∈R","A=0, B=−1/6,C=1/8,D∈R","None of these"],"a":0,"i":"M25-0016"},{"t":"Evaluate: ∫1/(1+3sin²x+8cos²x)dx","s":"I=∫1/(1+3sin²x+8cos²x)dx\nDividing the numerator and denominator by cos²x, we get\nI=∫sec²x/(sec²x+3tan²x+8)dx\n⇒I=∫sec²x/(1+tan²x+3tan²x+8)dx=∫sec²x/(4tan²x+9)dx\nPutting tanx=t⇒sec²xdx=dt, we get\nI=∫dt/(4t²+9)=1/4∫dt/(t²+(3/2)²)=1/4×1/(3/2)tan⁻¹(t/(3/2))+C\n⇒ I=1/6tan⁻¹(2t/3)+C=1/6tan⁻¹(2tanx/3)+C .","d":"H","p":"Integration by Substitution","k":"Test 1 (Topic Test)","o":["1/6tan⁻¹(2tanx)+C","tan⁻¹(2tanx)+C","1/6tan⁻¹(2tanx/3)+C","None of these"],"a":2,"i":"M25-0017"},{"t":"ϕ(x)=∫cot⁴xdx+1/3cot³x−cotx\nand ϕ(π/2)=π/2 then ϕ(x) is","s":"∫cot⁴xdx=∫cot²x⋅(cosec²x−1)dx\n=∫cot²xcosec²xdx−∫(cosec²x−1)dx\n=−1/3cot³x+cotx+x+c\n∴ϕ(x)=−1/3cot³x+cotx+x+c+1/3cot³x−cotx\n=x+c\n∴ϕ(π/2)=π/2+c, ∴c=0,∴ϕ(x)=x","d":"E","p":"Integration by Substitution","k":"Test 1 (Topic Test)","o":["π−x","x−π","π/2−x","x"],"a":3,"i":"M25-0018"},{"t":"∫sin2xdx/(sin⁴x+cos⁴x)=tan⁻¹(f(x))+c, then f(π/3)=","s":"Let\n[I =∫sin2xdx/(sin⁴x+cos⁴x); =∫2sinxcosx/(sin⁴x+cos⁴x)dx]\nDividing by cos²x in numerator and denominator, we get\n=∫2tanxsec²x/(1+(tan²x)²)dx\nAgain let tan²x=t\n[∴ I =∫dt/(1+t²); =tan⁻¹t+C; =tan⁻¹(tan²x)+C]\nBy comparing with tan⁻¹f(x)+C, we get\n[f(x) =tan²x; ∴ f(π/3) ={tan(π/3)}²=(√3)²=3.]","d":"M","p":"Integration by Substitution","k":"Test 1 (Topic Test)","o":["1","2","3","1/3"],"a":2,"i":"M25-0019"},{"t":"If ∫tan⁷xdx=f(x) then","s":"Putting tanx=t, we have dx=dt/(1+t²) so\n∫tan⁷xdx=∫t⁷/(1+t²)dt=∫(t⁵−t³+t−t/(1+t²))dt\n=t⁶/6−t⁴/4+t²/2−1/2log(1+t²)+C\n=1/6tan⁶x−1/4tan⁴x+1/2tan²x−1/2logsec²x+C=1/6tan⁶x−1/4tan⁴x+1/2tan²x+log|cosx|+C","d":"M","p":"Integration by Substitution","k":"Test 2 (Topic Test)","o":["f(x) is a polynomial of degree 8 in tanx","f(x) is a polynomial of degree 5 in tanx","f(x)=1/6tan⁶x−1/4tan⁴x+1/2tan²x+log|cosx|+C","f(x) is a polynomial of degree 6 in tanx"],"a":2,"i":"M25-0020"},{"t":"∫((x⁴−x)^(1/4))/x⁵ dx is equal to","s":"∫((x⁴−x)^(1/4))/x⁵ dx= ∫1/x⁴ (1−1/x³)^(1/4) dx\n=1/3 ∫t^(1/4) dt=4/15 t^(5/4)+c=4/15 (1−1/x³)^(5/4)+c\n{Putting 1−1/x³=t and 1/x⁴dx=1/3dt}","d":"E","p":"Integration by Substitution","k":"Test 2 (Topic Test)","o":["4/15(1−1/x³)^(5/4)+c","4/5 (1−1/x³)^(5/4)+c","4/15(1+1/x³)^(5/4)+c","None of these"],"a":0,"i":"M25-0021"},{"t":"If ∫x⁶sin(5x⁷)dx=k/5cos(5x⁷),x≠0, then","s":"Put 5x⁷=t⇒35x⁶dx=dt\n∴∫x⁶sin(5x⁷)dx=∫sint1/35dt=−1/35cost\n=−1/35cos(5x⁷)⇒−1/35=k/5⇒k=−1/7","d":"M","p":"Integration by Substitution","k":"Test 2 (Topic Test)","o":["k=7","k=−7","k=1/7","k=−1/7"],"a":3,"i":"M25-0022"},{"t":"∫sin2x/(acos²x+bsin²x)dx=","s":"∫sin2xdx/(acos²x+bsin²x)\nLet t=acos²x+bsin²x⇒dt=(−2acosxsinx+2bsinxcosx)dx\n[ ⇒dt/(b−a)=2sinxcosxdx; ⇒dt/(b−a)=sin2xdx; ∫sin2xdx/(acos²x+bsin²x); =1/(b−a)∫dt/t; =1/(b−a)log|t|+c]\n=1/(b−a)log|acos²x+bsin²x|+c where t=acos²x+bsin²x","d":"E","p":"Integration by Substitution","k":"Test 2 (Topic Test)","o":["(b−a)log(a−cos²x+bsin²x)","1/(b−a)log(acos²x+bsin²x)","1/(b−a)log(acos²x−bsin²x)","None of these"],"a":1,"i":"M25-0023"},{"t":"∫x²tan⁻¹x³/(1+x⁶)dx=","s":"Put tan⁻¹x³=t⇒1/(1+x⁶)3x²dx=dt\n∴I=1/3∫tdt=1/3t²/2+C\n1/6(tan⁻¹x³)²+C","d":"E","p":"Integration by Substitution","k":"Test 2 (Topic Test)","o":["tan⁻¹(x³)+C","1/6(tan⁻¹x³)²+C","1/2(tan⁻¹x³)²+C","1/2(tan⁻¹x²)³+C"],"a":1,"i":"M25-0024"},{"t":"∫√((cosx−cos³x)/(1−cos³x))dx=","s":"I=∫(√(cosx(1−cos²x)))/(√(1−cos³x))dx=∫√cosxsinx/(√(1−(cos^(3/2)x)²))dx\nPut cos^(3/2)x=t⇒3/2√cosx(−sinx)dx=dt\nI=2/3∫(−dt)/(√(1−t²))\n=2/3cos⁻¹(t)+C=2/3cos⁻¹(cos^(3/2)x)+C","d":"M","p":"Integration by Substitution","k":"Test 2 (Topic Test)","o":["2/3sin⁻¹(cos^(3/2)x)+C","3/2sin⁻¹(cos^(3/2)x)+C","2/3cos⁻¹(cos^(3/2)x)+C","None of these"],"a":2,"i":"M25-0025"},{"t":"∫dx/((2sinx+secx)⁴)=A(1+tanx)⁻⁵+B(1+tanx)⁻⁶+C(1+tanx)⁻⁷+k, then A+B+C=","s":"[ I=∫dx/((2sinx+secx)⁴)=∫sec⁴x/((2tanx+sec²x)⁴)dx; =∫(1+tan²x)/((1+tanx)⁸)sec²xdx]\nLet tanx=t⇒sec²xdx=dt\nSo,\n$\n$\nSo, A=(−1)/5,B=1/3 and C=−2/7\n∴A+B+C=−16/105","d":"M","p":"Integration by Substitution","k":"Test 2 (Topic Test)","o":["(−86)/105","(−1)/105","(−26)/105","(−16)/105"],"a":3,"i":"M25-0026"},{"t":"Let the equation of a curve passing through the point (0,1) be given by y=∫x²⋅e^(x³)dx. If the equation of the curve is written in the form x=f(y) then f(y) is","s":"y=∫x²⋅e^(x³)dx\nPut x³=t⇒3x²dx=dt\ny=∫eᵗ⋅dt/3=1/3eᵗ+C=1/3e^(x³)+C\nIt passes through (0,1) then 1=1/3e⁰+C⇒C=1−1/3=2/3\n∴y=1/3e^(x³)+2/3\n⇒e^(x³)+2=3y⇒e^(x³)=3y−2\n⇒x³=logₑ(3y−2)⇒x=∛(logₑ(3y−2))","d":"M","p":"Integration by Substitution","k":"Test 2 (Topic Test)","o":["√(logₑ(3y−2))","∛(logₑ(3y−2))","∛(logₑ(2−3y))","None of these"],"a":1,"i":"M25-0027"},{"t":"If ∫f(x)sinxcosxdx=1/(2(b²−a²))logₑ(f(x))+A\nb≠±a, then {f(x)}⁻¹ is equal to","s":"∫f(x)sinxcosxdx=1/(2(b²−a²))log(f(x))+C\ntherefore\nf(x)sinxcosx=1/(2(b²−a²))⋅1/(f(x))f^′(x)\n[by differentiating both the sides] ⇒2(b²−a²)sinxcosx=(f^′(x))/((f(x))²)\n∫(2b²sinxcosx−2a²sinxcosx)dx=∫(f^′(x))/((f(x))²)dx\n[by integrating both the sides] ⇒−b²cos²x−a²sin²x−C=−1/(f(x))","d":"M","p":"Integration by Substitution","k":"Test 2 (Topic Test)","o":["a²sin²x+b²cos²x+C","a²sin²x−b²cos²x+C","a²cos²x+b²sin²x+C","a²cos²x−b²sin²x+C"],"a":0,"i":"M25-0028"},{"t":"∫√(x/(1−x))dx is equal to","s":"Put x=sin²θ⇒dx=2sinθcosθ\n∫√(x/(1−x))dx=∫sinθ/cosθ⋅2sinθcosθdθ\n=∫(1−cos2θ)dθ=θ−1/2sin2θ+c\n=sin⁻¹√x−√(x(1−x))+c .","d":"H","p":"Integration by Substitution","k":"Test 2 (Topic Test)","o":["sin⁻¹√x+c","sin⁻¹{√x−√(x(1−x))}+c","sin⁻¹√(x(1−x))+c","sin⁻¹√x−√(x(1−x))+c"],"a":3,"i":"M25-0029"},{"t":"If ∫√(1+secx)dx=2(fog)(x)+C, then","s":"∫√(1+sec x)dx=∫(sec x⋅tan x)/(sec x⋅√(sec x−1))dx =∫(tan x)/(sec x−1)dx (Put sec x=t⇒sec x tan x dx=dt)=∫dt/(t√(t−1))=2∫ydy/((y²+1)y)( where y²=t−1)=2tan⁻¹y+C=2tan⁻¹√(sec x−1)+C∴f(x)=tan⁻¹x and g(x)=√(sec x−1).","d":"M","p":"Integration by Substitution","k":"Test 2 (Topic Test)","o":["f(x)=sec x-1","f(x)=2tan⁻¹ x","g(x)=√(sec x−1)","None of these"],"a":2,"i":"M25-0030"},{"t":"Iff(x)=ln(x−√(1+x²)), then what is ∫f^(′′)(x)dx\nequal to ?","s":"Given that f(x)=ln(x−√(1+x²))\n∫f^(′′)(x)dx=f^′(x)+c  where c is a constant\n=1/((x−√(1+x²)))⋅(1−2x/(2√(1+x²)))+c\n=(−(x−√(1+x²)))/((√(1+x²))(x−√(1+x²)))+c=−1/(√(1+x²))+c !","d":"M","p":"Integration by Substitution","k":"Test 2 (Topic Test)","o":["1/((x−√(1+x²)))+c","−1/(√(1+x²))+c","−√(1+x²)+c","ln(x−√(1+x²))+c"],"a":1,"i":"M25-0031"},{"t":"If ∫g(x)dx=g(x), then\n∫g(x){f(x)+f^′(x)}dx is equal to","s":"∫g(x){f(x)+f^′(x)}dx\n=∫g(x)f(x)dx+∫g(x)f^′(x)dx\n=f(x)∫g(x)dx−∫{f^′(x)∫g(x)dx}dx+∫g(x)f^′(x)dx\n[ Given ∫g(x)dx=g(x)]\n=f(x)g(x)+c !","d":"E","p":"Integration by Substitution","k":"Test 2 (Topic Test)","o":["g(x)f(x)−g(x)f^′(x)+C","g(x)f^′(x)+C","g(x)f(x)+C","g(x)f²(x)+C"],"a":2,"i":"M25-0032"},{"t":"∫dx/(sinx(3+cos²x)) is equal to (where y=cosx):","s":"Let I=∫dx/(sinx(3+cos²x))=∫(sinx dx)/(sin²x(3+cos²x))=∫(sinx dx)/((1−cos²x)(3+cos²x)).\nSubstituting y=cosx⇒dy=−sinx dx:\nI=∫(−dy)/((1−y²)(3+y²))=∫dy/((y²−1)(y²+3))\nUsing partial fractions:\n1/((y²−1)(y²+3))=1/4(1/(y²−1)−1/(y²+3))\nIntegrating with respect to y:\nI=1/4∫dy/(y²−1)−1/4∫dy/(y²+(√3)²)\nI=1/4⋅1/2log|(y−1)/(y+1)|−1/4⋅1/√3tan⁻¹y/√3+C\nI=1/8log|(y−1)/(y+1)|−1/4√3tan⁻¹y/√3+C","d":"H","p":"Integration by Substitution","k":"Test 2 (Topic Test)","o":["log|​y²−1|​−tan⁻¹y+C","tan⁻¹y/√3+C","log|​(y−1)/(y+1)|​+C","1/8log|​(y−1)/(y+1)|​−1/4√3tan⁻¹y/√3+C"],"a":3,"i":"M25-0033"},{"t":"If ∫secxcosecxdx=log|g(x)|+c, then what\nis g(x) equal to ?","s":"Let I=∫secx⋅cosecxdx\n=∫2/2sinxcosxdx\n=2∫1/sin2xdx−2∫1/(2tanx/(1+tan²x))\n[∵sin2x=2tanx/(1+tan²x)]\n=∫sec²x/tanxdx\nLettanx=t⇒sec²dx=dt\nSo,I=∫dt/t=log|t|+c=log|tanx|+c\nBut ∫secxcosecxdx=log|g(x)|+c\n∴ g(x)=tanx","d":"M","p":"Integration by Substitution","k":"Test 2 (Topic Test)","o":["sinxcosx","sec²x","tanx","log|tanx|"],"a":2,"i":"M25-0034"},{"t":"If ∫f(x)cosxdx=1/2f²(x)+c, then f(x) can be","s":"Since ∫[f(x)]ⁿf^′(x)dx=([f(x)]ⁿ⁺¹)/(n+1)+c\n∴∫f(x)cosxdx=(f²(x))/2+c\n⇒f^′(x)=cosx⇒f(x)=sinx","d":"M","p":"Integration by Substitution","k":"Test 2 (Topic Test)","o":["x","1","cosx","sinx"],"a":3,"i":"M25-0035"},{"t":"∫({f(x)⋅ϕ^′(x)−f^′(x)⋅ϕ(x)})/(f(x)⋅ϕ(x))log(ϕ(x))/(f(x))dx is equal to","s":"I=∫(f(x)ϕ^′(x)−f^′(x)ϕ(x))/(f(x)ϕ(x))log((ϕ(x))/(f(x)))dx\nPutting log(ϕ(x))/(f(x))=t\n(f(x))/(ϕ(x))⋅(f(x)ϕ^′(x)−f^′(x)ϕ(x))/((f(x))²)⋅dx=dt, we get\nI=∫tdt=1/2t²+k=1/2(log(ϕ(x))/(f(x)))²+k,k∈R .","d":"M","p":"Integration by Substitution","k":"Test 2 (Topic Test)","o":["log(ϕ(x))/(f(x))+k","1/2{log(ϕ(x))/(f(x))}²+k","(ϕ(x))/(f(x))log(ϕ(x))/(f(x))+k","None of these"],"a":1,"i":"M25-0036"},{"t":"∫(x²−1)/((x+1)²√(x³+x²+x))dx is equal to","s":"∫(x²−1)/((x+1)²√(x³+x²+x))dx\n=∫(x²−1)/((x²+2x+1)⋅x√(x+1/x+1))dx\n=∫(1−1/x²)/((x+1/x+2)√(x+1/x+1))dx=∫2zdz/((z²+1)⋅z)\n[ Putting x+1/x+1=z²⇒(1−1/x²)dx=2zdz\n=2∫dz/(1+z²)=2tan⁻¹z+C\n=2tan⁻¹√((x²+x+1)/x)+C","d":"H","p":"Integration by Substitution","k":"Test 2 (Topic Test)","o":["tan⁻¹√((x²+x+1)/x)+C","2tan⁻¹√((x²+x+1)/x)+C","3tan⁻¹√((x²+x+1)/x)+C","None of these"],"a":1,"i":"M25-0037"},{"t":"What is ∫logx/((1+logx)²)dx equal to?","s":"Let I=∫logx/((1+logx)²)dx\nPut logx=t⇒1/xdx=dt\nI=∫eᵗt/((1+t)²)dt=∫(eᵗ⋅(t+1−1))/((1+t)²)dt\n=∫(eᵗ(1+t))/((1+t)²)dt−∫eᵗ/((1+t)²)dt\n=∫eᵗ/(1+t)dt−∫eᵗ/((1+t)²)dt\n=eᵗ/(1+t)−∫−eᵗ1/((1+t)²)dt−∫eᵗ/((1+t)²)dt\n=eᵗ/(1+t)+∫_​^eᵗ 1/((1+t)²)dt−∫eᵗ/((1+t)²)dt\n=eᵗ/(1+t)+c=x/(1+logx)+c","d":"E","p":"Integration by Substitution","k":"Test 2 (Topic Test)","o":["1/((1+logx)³)+c","1/((1+logx)²)+c","x/(1+logx)+c","x/((1+logx)²)+c\nWhere c is a constant"],"a":2,"i":"M25-0038"},{"t":"∫(eˣ(1+sinx))/(1+cosx) dx is equal to","s":"∫(eˣ(1+sinx))/(1+cosx) dx\n=∫(eˣ[1+2sin(x/2)cos(x/2)])/(2cos²(x/2))dx\n=∫eˣ(1/2sec²x/2+tanx/2)dx\n=1/2∫eˣsec²x/2 dx+∫eˣtanx/2 dx\n=1/2∫eˣsec²x/2 dx+eˣtanx/2−1/2∫eˣsec²x/2+C\n[integrating by parts]\n=eˣtanx/2+C","d":"M","p":"Integration by Parts","k":"Test 3 (Topic Test)","o":["log|tanx|+C","eˣtanx/2+C","eˣcotx+C","sin log x+C"],"a":1,"i":"M25-0039"},{"t":"Let f and g be two polynomials then ∫(f(x)g^(′′)(x)−f^(′′)(x)g(x))dx is equal to (ignoring the constant of integration)","s":"∫(f(x)g^(′′)(x)−f^(′′)(x)g(x))dx\n= f(x)g^′(x)−∫f^′(x)g^′(x)dx\n−[g(x)f(x)−∫f^′(x)g^′(x)dx]\n=f(x)g^′(x)−g(x)f^′(x)","d":"M","p":"Integration by Parts","k":"Test 3 (Topic Test)","o":["(f(x))/(g^′(x))","f^′(x)g(x)−f(x)g^′(x)","f(x)g^′(x)−f^′(x)g(x)","f^′(x)g^′(x)+f^′(x)g(x)"],"a":2,"i":"M25-0040"},{"t":"∫dx/(x(x⁴+1)) is equal to","s":"∫dx/(x(x⁴+1))=1/4∫(4x³ dx)/(x⁴(x⁴+1))\n=1/4∫dt/(t(t+1)) (t=x⁴)\n=1/4∫(1/t−1/(t+1))dt=1/4logx⁴/(x⁴+1)+C","d":"E","p":"Integration using Partial Fraction","k":"Test 3 (Topic Test)","o":["1/4log(x⁴+1)/x⁴+C","1/4log(x⁴/(x⁴+1))+C","1/4log(x⁴+1)+C","none of these"],"a":1,"i":"M25-0041"},{"t":"If the primitive of f(x)=1/(3sinx+sin³x) is equal to 1/6log|(t−1)/(t+1)|+1/12log|(2+t)/(2−t)|+C then","s":"∫dx/(3sinx+sin³x)=∫(sinx dx)/((3+sin²x)sin²x)\n=∫(sinx dx)/((4−cos²x)(1−cos²x))\n=−∫dt/((4−t²)(1−t²))\n=−1/3∫(1/(t²−4)−1/(t²−1)) (t=cosx)\n=1/6log|(t−1)/(t+1)|+1/12log|(2+t)/(2−t)|+C","d":"H","p":"Integration using Partial Fraction","k":"Test 3 (Topic Test)","o":["t=cosx","t=tanx/2","t=2cosx","t=sinx"],"a":0,"i":"M25-0042"},{"t":"The integral I=∫2^((2ˣ+x))dx=λ.(2^(2ˣ))+C (where, C is the constant of integration). Then the value of √λ is equal to","s":"Given, I=∫2^(2ˣ).2ˣdx\nLet, 2^(2ˣ)=t⇒2^(2ˣ).2ˣ.(ln2)²dx=dt\n⇒2^(2ˣ).2ˣdx=dt/((ln2)²)\nThus, I=∫dt/((ln2)²)=t/((ln2)²)+C\n=(2^(2ˣ))/((ln2)²)+C\n∴λ=1/((ln2)²)⇒√λ=l/ln2","d":"H","p":"Integration by Parts","k":"Test 3 (Topic Test)","o":["1/ln4","1/((ln2)²)","1/ln2","1/((ln4)²)"],"a":2,"i":"M25-0043"},{"t":"∫(sin(logx)+cos(logx))dx=","s":"I=∫sin(logx)⋅1dx+∫cos(logx)⋅1dx\n(Integrating by parts the first integral)\n=sin(logx)⋅x−∫cos(logx)⋅1/xxdx+∫cos(logx)⋅dx\n=xsin(logx)+C","d":"E","p":"Integration by Parts","k":"Test 3 (Topic Test)","o":["xsin(logx)+C","xcos(logx)+C","sin(logx)−cos(logx)+C","None of these"],"a":0,"i":"M25-0044"},{"t":"∫xtan⁻¹xdx=","s":"I=(tan⁻¹x)x²/2−∫1/(1+x²)⋅x²/2dx\n=1/2x²tan⁻¹x−1/2∫(1+x²−1)/(1+x²)dx\n=1/2x²tan⁻¹x−1/2∫(1−1/(1+x²))dx etc.","d":"E","p":"Integration by Parts","k":"Test 3 (Topic Test)","o":["1/2(x²+1)tan⁻¹x−x","1/2(x²+1)tan⁻¹x−1/2x","(x²+1)tan⁻¹x−x","None of these"],"a":1,"i":"M25-0045"},{"t":"∫x|x|dx=","s":"I=∫x.|x|dx=∫|x|⋅xdx\n(Integrating by parts taking |x| as first function)\n=|x|⋅x²/2−∫(|x|)/x⋅x²/2dx=(x²|x|)/2−1/2∫|x|xdx\n⇒I(1+1/2)=(x²|x|)/2⇒I=1/3x²|x|","d":"E","p":"Integration by Parts","k":"Test 3 (Topic Test)","o":["x³/3","(x²|x|)/3","(x²|x|)/2","None of these"],"a":1,"i":"M25-0046"},{"t":"∫dx/(1+sinx+cosx)=","s":"We have, 1+sinx+cosx=(1+cosx)+sinx\n[=2cos²(x/2)+2sin(x/2)cos(x/2),; =2cos²(x/2){1+(sin(x/2))/(cos(x/2))}; =2/(sec²(x/2)){1+tan(x/2)}; ∴I=∫1/(1+sinx+cosx)dx; =∫(1/2⋅sec²(x/2))/(1+tan(x/2))dx; =∫(d/dx(1+tan(x/2)))/(1+tan(x/2))dx; =ln|1+tan(x/2)|+C,]","d":"M","p":"Integration by Parts","k":"Test 3 (Topic Test)","o":["log|1+tanx/2|+C","log|1+sinx+cosx|+C","2log|1+tanx/2|+C","1/2log|1+tanx/2|+C"],"a":0,"i":"M25-0047"},{"t":"∫(logx−1)/((logx)²)dx=","s":"I=∫1/logx−1/((logx)²)dx=∫1/logxdx−∫1/((logx)²)dx\n(Integrating by parts the first integral)\n=1/logx⋅x−∫(−1)/((logx)²)⋅1/x⋅xdx−∫1/((logx)²)dx\n=x/logx+C","d":"E","p":"Integration by Parts","k":"Test 3 (Topic Test)","o":["logx/x+C","x/logx+C","((logx)²−x)/logx","None of these"],"a":1,"i":"M25-0048"},{"t":"∫eˣ((x−1)/((x+1)³))dx=","s":"[ Let I=∫((x−1)eˣ)/((x+1)³)dx; ⇒I=∫{(x+1−2)/((x+1)³)}eˣdx; =∫{1/((x+1)²)−2/((x+1)³)}eˣdx; =∫eˣ⋅1/((x+1)²)dx−2∫eˣ1/((x+1)³)dx]\nApplying integrating by parts, we get\n[=(1/((x+1)²)eˣ−∫eˣ(−2)/((x+1)³)dx)−; 2∫eˣ1/((x+1)³)dx; =eˣ/((x+1)²)+C] .","d":"M","p":"Integration by Parts","k":"Test 3 (Topic Test)","o":["eˣ/(x+1)","eˣ/((x+1)²)","(−eˣ)/(x+1)","(−eˣ)/((x+1)²)"],"a":1,"i":"M25-0049"},{"t":"If ∫x(1+x)log(1+x²)dx=F(x)log(1+x²)−2/3tan⁻¹x−2x³/9−x²/2+2x/3+c, then F(x)=","s":"We have,\n$\n$\nLet $ I=x(1+x) (1+x^2) d x$\n=∫(x+x²)log(1+x²)dx\nNow, by using integration by parts, we get\n$\n$\nLet y₁=∫(x⋅x²)/(1+x²)dx\nPut x²=t\n$\n$\nLet $ I_2= d x= d x$\n$\n$\nOn substituting the value of I₁ and I₂ in Eq. (ii), we get\nI=log(1+x²)(x²/2+x³/3)−1/2x²+1/2log(1+x²)\n−2/9x³+2/3x−2/3tan⁻¹x+c\nwhere, C=(−2)/3C₂−C₁\n$\n$\nOn comparing this with Eq. (i), we get\nf(x)=x²/2+x³/3+1/2","d":"H","p":"Integration by Parts","k":"Test 3 (Topic Test)","o":["x²/2+x³/3","x²/2+x³/3−1/3","x²/2+x³/3+1/2","x²/2+x³/3−2/3"],"a":2,"i":"M25-0050"},{"t":"The value of ∫e^(tan⁻¹x)(1+x+x²)/(1+x²)dx is","s":"Put x=tanθ⇒dx=sec²θdθ\nI=∫e^θ(1+tanθ+tan²θ)/(1+tan²θ)⋅sec²θdθ\n=∫e^θ(tanθ+sec²θ)dθ\n=e^θtanθ+c=xe^(tan⁻¹x)+C !","d":"H","p":"Integration by Parts","k":"Test 3 (Topic Test)","o":["xe^(tan⁻¹)x+C","tan⁻¹x+C","e^(tan⁻¹x)+2x+C","None of these"],"a":0,"i":"M25-0051"},{"t":"∫32x³(logx)² dx is equal to","s":"Let I=∫32x³(logx)²dx\n=32{(logx)²x⁴/4−∫2logx1/x⋅x⁴/4dx}\n=32/4x⁴(logx)²−16∫x³logxdx\n=8x⁴(logx)²−4x⁴logx+4∫x³dx\n=x⁴{8(logx)²−4logx+1}+C !","d":"M","p":"Integration by Parts","k":"Test 3 (Topic Test)","o":["8x⁴(logx)²+C","x⁴{8(logx)²−4(logx)+1}+C","x⁴{8(logx)²−4(logx)}+C","x³{(logx)²−2logx}+C"],"a":1,"i":"M25-0052"},{"t":"If ∫f(x)dx=g(x)+c, then ∫f⁻¹(x)dx is equal\nto","s":"Let I=∫f⁻¹(x)dx\nand f⁻¹(x)=t⇒x=f(t)⇒dx=f^′(t)dt\nPut value of dx and f⁻¹(x) in I, we get I=∫tf^′(t)dt\nNow, integrate it by parts, I=tf(t)−∫f(t)dt\nGiven, ∫f(x)dx=g(x)+C\n∴I=tf(t)−[g(t)]+C\nNow, by putting value of t,f(t) and g(t) we get, I=xf⁻¹(x)−g[f⁻¹(x)]+C","d":"M","p":"Integration by Parts","k":"Test 3 (Topic Test)","o":["xf⁻¹(x)+C","f(g⁻¹(x))+C","xf⁻¹(x)−g(f⁻¹(x))+C","g⁻¹(x)+C"],"a":2,"i":"M25-0053"},{"t":"If ∫xeˣ/(√(1+eˣ))dx=f(x)√(1+eˣ)−2logg(x)+C, then","s":"I=∫xeˣ/(√(1+eˣ))dx we have\n∫eˣ/(√(1+eˣ))dx=2√(1+eˣ)\nIntegrating I by parts with x as first function I=x.2√(1+eˣ)−∫2√(1+eˣ)dx\n=2x√(1+eˣ)−2∫t⋅2tdt/(t²−1)( Putting 1+eˣ=t²)\n=2x√(1+eˣ)−4∫(t²−1+1)/(t²−1)dt\n=2x√(1+eˣ)−4[t+1/2log(t−1)/(t+1)]+c\n=2(x−2)√(1+eˣ)−2log((√(1+eˣ)−1)/(√(1+eˣ)+1))+c","d":"H","p":"Integration by Parts","k":"Test 3 (Topic Test)","o":["f(x)=x−1","g(x)=(√(1+eˣ)−1)/(√(1+eˣ)+1)","g(x)=(√(1+eˣ)+1)/(√(1+eˣ)−1)","f(x)=2(2−x)"],"a":1,"i":"M25-0054"},{"t":"What is ∫sinxlog(tanx)dx equal to?","s":"∫sinxlog(tanx)dx\n=−cosxlogtanx−∫(−cosx)1/tanx⋅sec²xdx\n=−cosxlogtanx+∫1/sinxdx\n=−cosxlog(tanx)+∫(1+tan²x/2)/(2tanx/2)dx\nNow putting x/2=t, we get,\n=−cosxlogtanx+∫1/t⋅dt\n=−cosxlogtanx+log(t)+c\n=−cosxlogtanx+logtan(x/2)+c","d":"E","p":"Integration by Parts","k":"Test 3 (Topic Test)","o":["cosxlogtanx+logtan(x/2)+c","−cosxlogtanx+logtan(x/2)+c","cosxlogtanx+logcot(x/2)+c","−cosxlogtanx+logcot(x/2)+c"],"a":1,"i":"M25-0055"},{"t":"∫xeˣ/((1+x)²)dx=","s":"∫xeˣ/((1+x)²)dx=∫((x+1−1)/((1+x)²))ˣdx\n=∫(1/(1+x)−1/((1+x)²))eˣdx=eˣ/(1+x)+C .","d":"M","p":"Integration using Partial Fraction","k":"Test 3 (Topic Test)","o":["−eˣ/(1+x)+C","(1+2xeˣ)/(1+x)+C","−(1+2xeˣ)/(1+x)+C","eˣ/(1+x)+C"],"a":3,"i":"M25-0056"},{"t":"∫x²/((x²+1)(x²+4))dx is equal to","s":"∫x²/((x²+1)(x²+4))dx.\n=1/3∫[4/(x²+4)−1/(x²+1)]dx\n=−1/3∫1/(x²+1)dx+4/3∫1/(x²+4)dx\n=−1/3tan⁻¹x+4/3×1/2tan⁻¹(x/2)+C\n=−1/3tan⁻¹x+2/3tan⁻¹(x/2)+C","d":"M","p":"Integration using Partial Fraction","k":"Test 3 (Topic Test)","o":["tan⁻¹x+2tan⁻¹(x/2)+C","tan⁻¹(x/2)−4tan⁻¹x+C","−1/3tan⁻¹x+2/3tan⁻¹(x/2)+C","4tan⁻¹(x/2)−2tan⁻¹x+C"],"a":2,"i":"M25-0057"},{"t":"∫(1+x)/(x(1+xeˣ)²)dx","s":"I=∫(1+x)/(x(1+xeˣ)²)dx=∫((1+x)eˣ)/(xeˣ(1+xeˣ)²)dx\nPut xeˣ=t⇒(eˣ+xeˣ)dx=dt\nI=∫dt/(t(1+t)²)\nLet 1/(t(1+t)²)=A/t+B/(1+t)+D/((1+t)²), we get\nA=1/((1+0)²)=1,D=1/(−1)=−1\nEquating coefficient of t²,0=A+B⇒B=−1\n∴I=∫[1/t−1/(1+t)−1/((1+t)²)]dt\n=ln|t|−ln|1+t|+1/(1+t)+C\n=ln|t/(1+t)|+1/(1+t)+C\n=ln|xeˣ/(1+xeˣ)|+1/(1+xeˣ)+C","d":"M","p":"Integration using Partial Fraction","k":"Test 3 (Topic Test)","o":["ln|xeˣ/(1+xeˣ)|+1/(1+xeˣ)+C","(1+xeˣ)+ln|xeˣ/(1+xeˣ)|+C","1/(1+xeˣ)+ln|xeˣ(1+xeˣ)|+C","None of these"],"a":0,"i":"M25-0058"},{"t":"Let f be a continuous function satisfying f(x+y) =f(x)f(y)(x,y∈R with f(1)=e then the value of ∫(xf(x))/(√(1+f(x)))dx is","s":"First show that f(x)=eˣ\n[ Let I =∫xeˣ/(√(1+eˣ))dx; =2x√(1+eˣ)−2I₁]\nPut 1+eˣ=t²,\nso that I₁=∫t2t/(t²−1)dt=2∫[1+1/(t²−1)]dt\n=2[t+1/2log|(t−1)/(t+1)|]\n=2√(1+eˣ)+log|(√(1+eˣ)−1)/(√(1+eˣ)+1)|\nThus, I=2x√(1+eˣ)−4√(1+eˣ)−2log|(√(1+eˣ)−1)/(√(1+eˣ)+1)|+C","d":"H","p":"Miscellaneous Forms","k":"Test 4 (Topic Test)","o":["2x√(1+eˣ)−4√(1+eˣ)−2log|(√(1+eˣ)−1)/(√(1+eˣ)+1)|+C","2√(1+eˣ)−4√(1+f(x))\n−2log|√(1+f(x))−1|+C","2√(1+f(x))−4√(1+f(x))−2log|(√(1+f(x))−1)/(√(1+f(x))+1)|+C","none of these"],"a":0,"i":"M25-0059"},{"t":"Let f be a continuous function satisfying f(x+y)=f(x)+f(y), for each x,y∈R and f(1)=2 then ∫(f(x)tan⁻¹x)/((1+x²)²) dx is equal to","s":"First show that f(x)=2x.\nNow, I=∫(f(x)tan⁻¹x)/((1+x²)²)dx=∫2x/((1+x²)²)tan⁻¹xdx\nPut x=tanθ, so that\nI=∫2tanθ/sec⁴θθsec²θdθ\n=∫θsin(2θ)dθ\n=−1/2θcos2θ+1/4sin2θ+C\n=C−1/2θ(1−tan²θ)/(1+tan²θ)+1/2tanθ/(1+tan²θ)\n=C−1/2(1−x²)/(1+x²)tan⁻¹x+1/2x/(1+x²)\n=C−1/(1+x²)tan⁻¹x+1/2tan⁻¹x+1/2x/(1+x²).","d":"M","p":"Miscellaneous Forms","k":"Test 4 (Topic Test)","o":["cannot be determined explicitly","C−tan⁻¹x/(2(1+x²))+1/4tan⁻¹x+(f(x))/(1+(f(x))²)","C−tanx/(2(1+x²))+tan⁻¹x/4+x/(4(1+x²))","C−1/(1+x²)tan⁻¹x+1/2tan⁻¹x+x/(2(1+x²))"],"a":3,"i":"M25-0060"},{"t":"If ∫dx/((1+√x)√(x−x²))=A√x/(√(1−x))+B/(√(1−x))+C, where C is real constant, then A+B equals to","s":"Given,\n∫dx/((1+√x)(√(x²−x²)))=A√x/(√(1−x))+B/(√(1−x))+c\nOn differentiating both sides, we get\n[ 1/((1+√x)(√(x−x²))); =(√(1−x)(A1/2√x)−(A√x+B)1/(2√(2−x))(−1))/((√(1−x))²); ⇒1/((1+√x)(√(x−x²)))=((1−x)A+Ax+B√x)/((1−x)2√x√(1−x)); ⇒ (2(1−x))/(1+√x)=A+B√x; ⇒ 2−2√x=A+B√x; ⇒A=2,B=−2; ∴A+B=0; ]","d":"H","p":"Miscellaneous Forms","k":"Test 4 (Topic Test)","o":["3","0","1","2"],"a":1,"i":"M25-0061"},{"t":"If f(x)=√(x²+4) then ∫(f(x))/x⁶ dx is equal to","s":"I=∫(√(x²+4))/x⁶dx=∫(√(1+4/x²))/x²dx/x³\nPut 1/x²=t, so that\nI=∫t√(1+4t)(−1)/2dt\n=−1/8∫(4t+1−1)√(1+4t)dt\n=−1/8[(4t+1)^(5/2)(2/5)(1/4)−(2/3)(1/4)(1+4t)^(3/2)]+C\n=1/48(1+4/x²)^(3/2)−1/80(1+4/x²)^(5/2)+C\n=1/240x⁵[5x²(f(x))³−3(f(x))⁵]+C","d":"H","p":"Miscellaneous Forms","k":"Test 4 (Topic Test)","o":["=1/240x⁵[5x²(f(x))³−3(f(x))⁵]+C","((f(x))³((f(x))²−4))/6x⁵+C","((f(x))²((f(x))³−2))/20x⁴+C","((f(x))³(x²−6))/6x⁵+C"],"a":0,"i":"M25-0062"},{"t":"If Iₙ=∫cotⁿx dx, and I₀+I₁+2(I₂+…+I₈)+I₉+I₁₀=A(u+u²/2+…+u⁹/9), where u=cotx then","s":"Iₙ+Iₙ₊₂=∫cotⁿxcosec²xdx=−1/(n+1)cotⁿ⁺¹x\nNow,\nI₀+I₁+2(I₂+I₃+⋯+I₈)+I₉+I₁₀\n=(I₀+I₂)+(I₁+I₃)+(I₂+I₄)\n+⋯+(I₇+I₉)+(I₈+I₁₀)\n=−(u+1/2u²+1/3u³+⋯+1/9u⁹)\nwhere u=cotx.\nThus, A=−1 .","d":"H","p":"Miscellaneous Forms","k":"Test 4 (Topic Test)","o":["A=1","A=−1","A=1/2","A=−1/2"],"a":1,"i":"M25-0063"},{"t":"f(x)=∫dx/sin⁴x is a","s":"f(x)=∫(1+cot²x)cosec²xdx\n=−(cotx+1/3cot³x)+C\nwhich is a polynomial of degree 3.","d":"M","p":"Miscellaneous Forms","k":"Test 4 (Topic Test)","o":["polynomial of degree 3 in cotx","polynomial of degree 4 in cotx","polynomial of degree 4 in sinx","polynomial of degree 3 in tanx"],"a":0,"i":"M25-0064"},{"t":"If ∫f(x)dx=ϕ(x) i.e. ϕ is a function such that ϕ^′(x) =f(x), then ∫x⁹f(x⁵)dx is equal to","s":"Let x⁵=t, so ∫x⁹f(x⁵)dx\n=1/5∫tf(t)dt\n=1/5[t∫f(t)dt−∫ϕ(t)dt]\n=1/5[x⁵ϕ(x⁵)−5∫ϕ(x⁵)x⁴dx]+C\n=1/5x⁵ϕ(x⁵)−∫x⁴ϕ(x⁵)dx+C !","d":"M","p":"Miscellaneous Forms","k":"Test 4 (Topic Test)","o":["1/5[x⁵ϕ(x⁵)−∫x⁴ϕ(x⁵)dx]+C","1/5x⁵ϕ(x⁵)−5∫x⁵ϕ(x⁵)dx+C","1/5x⁵ϕ(x⁵)−∫x⁴ϕ(x⁵)dx+C","1/5[x⁵ϕ(x⁵)−∫x⁵ϕ(x⁵)dx]+C"],"a":2,"i":"M25-0065"},{"t":"∫dx/(cosx−sinx) is equal to","s":"∫dx/(cosx−sinx)=∫dx/(cosx+cos(π/2+x))\n=1/2∫dx/(cos(π/4)cos(x+π/4))\n=1/√2∫sec(x+π/4)dx\n=1/√2log|tan(x/2+π/8+π/4)|+C\n=1/√2log|tan(x/2+3π/8)|+C !","d":"E","p":"Miscellaneous Forms","k":"Test 4 (Topic Test)","o":["1/√2log|tan(x/2−3π/8)|+C","1/√2log|cotx/2|+C","1/√2log|tan(x/2−π/8)|+C","1/√2log|tan(x/2+3π/8)|+C"],"a":3,"i":"M25-0066"},{"t":"If tanα=4/3, then ∫1/(3cosx−4sinx)dx=","s":"Given tanα=4/3 and ∫1/(3cosx−4sinx)dx\n$\n$\nHere, cosα=3/5\n$\n$ I=1/5log|(1+tan(x+α)/2)/(1−tan(x+α)/2)|=1/5log|tan(π/4+x/2+α/2)|+c Option (b) is correct.","d":"M","p":"Miscellaneous Forms","k":"Test 4 (Topic Test)","o":["1/5log|tan(x/2+α/2)|+c","1/5log|tan(π/4+x/2+α/2)|+c","1/5log|tan(π/4−x/2−α/2)|+c","1/5log|tan(secx+tanx)|+c"],"a":1,"i":"M25-0067"},{"t":"If ∫dx/(x+x⁷)=p(x) then, ∫x⁶/(x+x⁷)dx is equal to","s":"∫x⁶/(x+x⁷)dx=∫(1+x⁶−1)/(x(1+x⁶))dx=∫1/xdx−∫dx/(x+x⁷)\n=log|x|−p(x)+C","d":"M","p":"Miscellaneous Forms","k":"Test 4 (Topic Test)","o":["log|x|−p(x)+C","log|x|+p(x)+C","x−p(x)+C","x+p(x)+C"],"a":0,"i":"M25-0068"},{"t":"∫(sin⁸x−cos⁸x)/(1−2sin²xcos²x)dx=","s":"Now, sin⁸x−cos⁸x\n=(sin⁴x−cos⁴x)(sin⁴x+cos⁴x)\n=(sin²x−cos²x)\n(sin⁴x+cos⁴x+2sin²xcos²x−2sin²xcos²x)\n=(sin²x−cos²x)((sin²x+cos²x)²−2sin²xcos²x)\n=(sin²x−cos²x)(1−2sin²xcos²x)\n∴I=−∫(cos²x−sin²x)dx\n=−∫cos2xdx=−1/2sin2x+C","d":"H","p":"Miscellaneous Forms","k":"Test 4 (Topic Test)","o":["sin2x+C","−1/2sin2x+C","1/2sin2x+C","−sin2x+C"],"a":1,"i":"M25-0069"},{"t":"∫(1−cosx)cosec²xdx=","s":"I=∫(1−cosx)cosec²xdx\n=∫cosec²xdx−∫cosecxcotxdx\n=−cotx+cosecx+C\n=(1−cosx)/sinx+C=(2sin²x/2)/(2sinx/2cosx/2)+C=tanx/2+C .","d":"M","p":"Miscellaneous Forms","k":"Test 4 (Topic Test)","o":["tanx/2+C","cot(x/2)+C","1/2tanx/2+C","2tanx/2+C"],"a":0,"i":"M25-0070"},{"t":"Let f(x)=∫eˣ(x−1)(x−2)dx\nThen f decreases in the interval","s":"f(x)=∫eˣ(x−1)(x−2)dx\nFor decreasing function, f^′(x)<0 ⇒eˣ(x−1)(x−2)<0\n⇒(x−1)(x−2)<0\n⇒1<x<2\neˣ>0∀x∈R","d":"M","p":"Miscellaneous Forms","k":"Test 4 (Topic Test)","o":["(−∞,−2)","(−2,−1)","(1,2)","(2,+∞)"],"a":2,"i":"M25-0071"},{"t":"If lʳ(x) means logloglog….x, the log being\nrepeated r times. then ∫{xl(x)l²(x)l³(x)…lʳ(x)}⁻¹ dx is equal to","s":"Putting lʳ⁺¹(x)=t and 1/(xl²(x)l³(x)….lʳ(x))dx=dt\nwe get, ∫1/(xl²(x)l³(x)….lʳ(x))\n=∫1.dt=t+C=lʳ⁺¹(x)+C","d":"M","p":"Miscellaneous Forms","k":"Test 4 (Topic Test)","o":["lʳ⁺¹(x)+C","(lʳ⁺¹(x))/(r+1)+C","lʳ(x)+C","None"],"a":0,"i":"M25-0072"},{"t":"If ∫dx/(f(x))=log{f(x)}²+c, then what is f(x) equal to ?","s":"We check from the given options one by one. Options (1), (2) and (4) do not satisfy. We check option (3).\nLet f(x)=x/2+α\n∴∫dx/(x/2+α)=∫2dx/(x+2α)\n=2log(x+2α)+c₁=log(x+2α)²+c₁\n=log(x/2+α)²+log2²+c₁\n=log(x/2+α)²+c","d":"H","p":"Miscellaneous Forms","k":"Test 4 (Topic Test)","o":["2x+α","x+α","x/2+α","x²+α"],"a":2,"i":"M25-0073"},{"t":"If ∫√cotx/sinxcosxdx=a√cotx+b find the vale of a","s":"Put tanx=t, where I=2∫√cotx/sin2xdx=∫t^(−3/2)dt=−2√cotx+b","d":"E","p":"Integration by Substitution","k":"Chapter Test","o":["1","2","−1","−2"],"a":3,"i":"M25-0074"},{"t":"∫[1/logx−1/((logx)²)]dx=","s":"Let I=∫(1/logx−1/((logx)²))dx Put logx=t ⇒x=eᵗ ⇒dx=eᵗdt ∴I=∫eᵗ(1/t−1/t²)dt Here, f(t)=1/t ⇒f^′(t)=(−1)/t² let eᵗ×1/t=p Diff both sides w.r.t t (eᵗ×1/t+eᵗ×(−1)/t²)dt=dp ∴I=∫dp =p+C =eᵗ/t+C =x/logx+C","d":"E","p":"Integration by Substitution","k":"Chapter Test","o":["x/logx+c","xlogx+c","logx/x+c","none of these"],"a":0,"i":"M25-0075"},{"t":"Given ∫eˣ(tanx+1)sec x dx =eˣf(x)+C\nA satisfying value of f(x) would be:","s":"Given : ∫eˣ(tan x+1)sec x dx=eˣf(x)+C                   ...(1) L.H.S [=∫eˣ(tan x+1)secx dx; =∫eˣ(secx+secxtanx) dx; =∫eˣsecx dx+∫eˣsecx tanx dx] (Integrating first by parts) [=eˣ(secx+tanx) + eˣsecx−eˣ(sec xtanx) +C; =eˣsecx+C; =eˣf(x)+C                        ...[Using (1)]] On comparing , we get f(x)=secx.","d":"M","p":"Integration by Parts","k":"Chapter Test","o":["sin x","cosec x","sec x","tan x"],"a":2,"i":"M25-0076"},{"t":"∫(logx)³x⁵dx=","s":"∫(logx)³x_(II)⁵dx\nUsing by parts\n[ =(logx)³∫x⁵dx−∫[d/dx(logx)³∫x⁵dx]dx; =(logx)³⋅x⁶/6−∫(3⋅(logx)²)/x⋅x⁶/6dx; =x⁶/6(logx)³−1/2∫ta_(I) (logx)²⋅x⁵dx; =x⁶/6(logx)³−1/2; =x⁶/6(logx)³−1/12x⁶(logx)²+1/2∫2logx/x⋅x⁶/6dx; =x⁶/6(logx)³−x⁶/12(logx)²+1/6∫(logx)⋅x⁵dx; =x⁶/6(logx)³−x⁶/12(logx)²;  +1/6[logx∫x⁵dx−∫x−∫{d/dx(logx)∫x⁵dx}dx]\n[ =x⁶/6(logx)³−x⁶/12(logx)²+1/6(logx)⋅x⁶/6; =x⁶/6(logx)³−x⁶/12(logx)²+x⁶/36⋅x⁶/6dx; =x⁶/6(logx−1/36∫x⁵dx; =x⁶[x⁶/12(logx)²+x⁶/36(logx)−1/36(x⁶/6)+C)]","d":"E","p":"Integration by Parts","k":"Chapter Test","o":["x⁶[((logx)³)/12−1/6(logx)²+1/6logx−1/36]+c","x⁶[((logx)³)/6−1/18(logx)²+logx/12−1/36]+c","x⁶[((logx)³)/6+1/12(logx)²−logx/12+1/36]+c","x⁶[((logx)³)/6−((logx)²)/12+logx/36−1/216]+c"],"a":3,"i":"M25-0077"},{"t":"∫eˣˢⁱⁿˣ(x²cosx+xsinx+1)dx, equals (where C is constant of integration)","s":"Let I=∫eˣˢⁱⁿˣ(x²cosx+xsinx+1)dx⇒I=∫(x.(xcosx+sinx)eˣˢⁱⁿˣ+1.eˣˢⁱⁿˣ)dx\nLet eˣˢⁱⁿˣ=t⇒eˣˢⁱⁿˣ(sinx+xcosx)dx=dt Using integration by parts,I=∫(xdt/dx+t)dx=x t+C=x eˣˢⁱⁿˣ+C, where C is the constant of integration.","d":"M","p":"Integration by Parts","k":"Chapter Test","o":["xe^(x²sinx)+C","x²eˣˢⁱⁿˣ+C","xeˣˢⁱⁿˣ+C","2x²e^(x sinx)+C"],"a":2,"i":"M25-0078"},{"t":"The value of the integral ∫((lnx−1)/((lnx)²+1))²dx is","s":"Put lnx=t\nI=∫eᵗ((t−1)/(t²+1))²dt=∫eᵗ(1/(t²+1)−2t/((t²+1)²))dt=eᵗ/(t²+1)+c=x/((lnx)²+1)+c","d":"M","p":"Integration by Parts","k":"Chapter Test","o":["x/(x²+1)+c","lnx/((lnx)²+1)","x/((lnx)²+1)+c","eˣ(x/(x²+1))+c"],"a":2,"i":"M25-0079"},{"t":"Evaluate ∫(2x+1)/((x+2)(x−3))","s":"Let I=∫(2x+1)/((x+2)(x−3)) Let (2x+1)/((x+2)(x−3))=A/(x+2)+B/(x−3) ...(1) (2x+1)/((x+2)(x−3))=(A(x−3)+B(x+2))/((x+2)(x−3)) 2x+1=A(x−3)+B(x+2) ...(2) Put x=3, in (2) we get 6+1=0+B(3+2) 7=5B⇒B=7/5 Put x=−2, in (2)we get −4+1=A(−2−3)+0 −3=−5A⇒A=3/5Putting the value of A and B in equation (1) and integrating, we get I=∫(3/5)/(x+2)dx+∫(7/5)/(x−3)dx =3/5log|x+2|+7/5log|x−3|+C","d":"H","p":"Integration using Partial Fraction","k":"Chapter Test","o":["3/5log|x+2|+7/5log|x−3|+C","0","(−2)/9log|x|(−3)/2log|x+3|+C","None of these"],"a":0,"i":"M25-0080"},{"t":"The value of ∫(d(sinx))/(√(1−sin²x)) is equal to","s":"Let sinx=z⇒d(sinx)=dz\n∫dz/(√(1−z²))=sin⁻¹z+c=sin⁻¹(sinx)+c=x+c","d":"E","p":"Integration by Substitution","k":"Chapter Test","o":["x+c","3x+c","x²+c","none of these"],"a":0,"i":"M25-0081"},{"t":"∫eˣ(1+sinx)/(1+cosx)dx is equal to","s":"∫eˣ((1+2sin(x/2)cos(x/2))/(2cos²x/2))dx=∫eˣ(tanx/2+1/2sec²x/2)dx=eˣtanx/2+c","d":"M","p":"Integration by Parts","k":"Chapter Test","o":["eˣcos(x/2)+c","eˣtan(x/2)+c","eˣtanx+c","eˣcotx+c"],"a":1,"i":"M25-0082"},{"t":"∫tan⁻¹√xdx is equal to","s":"I=∫tan⁻¹√xdx=x⋅tan⁻¹√x−∫1/(1+x)⋅2/2√x⋅xdx=x⋅tan⁻¹√x−1/2∫√x/(1+x)dx\nNow putting √x=t i.e., 1/2√xdx=dt","d":"M","p":"Integration by Parts","k":"Chapter Test","o":["(x+1)tan⁻¹√x−√x+C","x⋅tan⁻¹√x−√x+C","√x−xtan⁻¹√x+C","√x−(x+1)tan⁻¹√x+C"],"a":0,"i":"M25-0083"},{"t":"∫({f(x)⋅ϕ^′(x)−f^′(x)⋅ϕ(x)})/(f(x)⋅ϕ(x)){logϕ(x)−logf(x)}dx","s":"I=∫log(ϕ(x))/(f(x))d{log(ϕ(x))/(f(x))}=1/2{log(ϕ(x))/(f(x))}²+k .","d":"M","p":"Integration by Substitution","k":"Chapter Test","o":["log(ϕ(x))/(f(x))+k","1/2{log(ϕ(x))/(f(x))}²+k","(ϕ(x))/(f(x))log(ϕ(x))/(f(x))+k","none of these"],"a":1,"i":"M25-0084"},{"t":"If ∫f(x)dx=F(x), then ∫x³f(x²)dx is equal to","s":"Put x²=t⇒x⋅dx=dt/2","d":"E","p":"Integration by Substitution","k":"Chapter Test","o":["1/2(x²F(x²)−∫F(x²)dx²)","1/2(x²F(x²)−∫F(x²)dx)","1/2(x²F(x)−1/2∫F(x²)dx)","none of these"],"a":0,"i":"M25-0085"},{"t":"The value of the integral ∫((1−cosθ)^(2/7))/((1+cosθ)^(9/7))dθ is","s":"Let I=∫((1−cosθ)^(2/7))/((1+cosθ)^(9/7))dθ\n,I=∫((2sin²θ/2)^(2/7))/((2cos²θ/2)^(9/2))dθ=1/2∫((sinθ/2)^(4/7))/((cosθ/2)^(18/7))dθ\nPut θ/2=t∴dθ/2=dt\n⇒ I=∫((sint)^(4/7))/((cost)^(18/7))dt\n( Here m+n=−2)\n=∫(tant)^(4/7)sec²tdt\nPut tant=u∴sec²tdt=du\n\n) !","d":"M","p":"Integration by Substitution","k":"Chapter Test","o":["7/11(tanθ/2)^(11/7)+C","7/11(cosθ/2)^(11/7)+C","7/11(sinθ/2)^(11/7)+C","None of these"],"a":0,"i":"M25-0086"},{"t":"If ∫dx/(1+eˣ)=x+Klog(1+eˣ)+C then K is equal to","s":"Substituting 1+eˣ=t, we have\n\n) !","d":"M","p":"Integration by Substitution","k":"Chapter Test","o":["1","−1","2","−2"],"a":1,"i":"M25-0087"},{"t":"∫x/((x²−a²)(x²−b²))dx=?","s":"Let, I=∫xdx/((x²−a²)(x²−b²))\nPut x²=t⇒xdx=1/2dt\n∴ I=1/2∫dt/((t−a²)(t−b²))\n=1/2∫{dt/((a²−b²)(t−a²))−dt/((a²−b²)(t−b²))}\n=1/(2(a²−b²))log|(t−a²)/(t−b²)|+C\n⇒I=1/(2(a²−b²))log|(x²−a²)/(x²−b²)|+C","d":"M","p":"Integration by Substitution","k":"Chapter Test","o":["1/(a²−b²)log|(x²−a²)/(x²−b²)|+C","1/(a²−b²)log|(x²−b²)/(x²−a²)|+C","1/(2(a²−b²))log|(x²−a²)/(x²−b²)|+C","1/(2(a²−b²))log|(x²−b²)/(x²−a²)|+C"],"a":2,"i":"M25-0088"},{"t":"If f((3x−4)/(3x+4))=x+2, then ∫f(x)dx is:","s":"Put x=(3t−4)/(3t+4)=1−8/(3t+4),dx=24/((3t+4)²)dt","d":"H","p":"Integration using Partial Fraction","k":"Chapter Test","o":["eˣ⁺²log|(3x−4)/(3x+4)|+c","−8/3log|1−x|+2/3x+c","8/3log|1−x|+x/3+c","e^([(3x−4)(3x+4)])−x²/2−2x+c"],"a":1,"i":"M25-0089"},{"t":"If f(x)=logx/x³, then its antiderivative F(x) given by","s":"F(x)=∫logx/x³dx=logx∫1/x³dx−","d":"E","p":"Integration by Parts","k":"Chapter Test","o":["C−1/2x²log(x√e)","C+1/2x²logx","C−1/2x²log(xe)","C+1/2x³log(xe)"],"a":0,"i":"M25-0090"},{"t":"The value of ∫sinx/sin4x dx is","s":"The given integrand can be written as 1/4cosxcos2x=cosx/(4(1−sin²x)(1−2sin²x)),\nhence ∫sinx/sin4x dx=1/4∫dt/((1−t²)(1−2t²)) (t=sinx)\n=1/4∫[1/(t²−1)−1/(t²−1/2)]dt\n=1/4[1/2log|(t−1)/(t+1)|−1/√2log|(t−1/√2)/(t+1/√2)|]+C\n=1/8log|(sinx−1)/(sinx+1)|−1/4√2log|(√2sinx−1)/(√2sinx+1)|+C. .","d":"M","p":"Integration using Partial Fraction","k":"Chapter Test","o":["1/4log|(sinx−1)/(sinx+1)|−1/√2log|(√2sinx−1)/(√2sinx+1)|+C","1/8log|(cosx−1)/(cosx+1)|−1/2√2log|(√2cosx−1)/(√2cosx+1)|+C","1/8log|(sinx−1)/(sinx+1)|−1/4√2log|(√2sinx−1)/(√2sinx+1)|+C","none of these"],"a":2,"i":"M25-0091"},{"t":"Let I=∫eˣ/(e⁴ˣ+e²ˣ+1)dx,J= ∫e⁻ˣ/(e⁻⁴ˣ+e⁻²ˣ+1)dx. Then for an arbitrary constant C, the value of I−J equals","s":"I−J=∫eˣ/(e⁴ˣ+e²ˣ+1)dx−∫e³ˣ/(e⁴ˣ+e²ˣ+1)dx\n=∫(eˣ(1−e²ˣ))/(e⁴ˣ+e²ˣ+1)dx\nPut  eˣ=t,eˣdx=dt\nI−J=∫(1−t²)/(t⁴+t²+1)dt=∫(1/t²−1)/(t²+1/t²+1)dt\n[1−1/t²; u=t+1/t]\n=1/2log|(1+u)/(1−u)|+C\n=1/2log|(eˣ+e⁻ˣ+1)/(eˣ+e⁻ˣ−1)|+C\n=1/2log|(e²ˣ+eˣ+1)/(e²ˣ−eˣ+1)|+C.","d":"H","p":"Integration by Substitution","k":"Chapter Test","o":["1/2log((e⁴ˣ−e²ˣ+1)/(e⁴ˣ+e²ˣ+1))+C","1/2log((e²ˣ+eˣ+1)/(e²ˣ−eˣ+1))+C","1/2log((e²ˣ−eˣ+1)/(e²ˣ+eˣ+1))+C","1/2log((e⁴ˣ+e²ˣ+1)/(e⁴ˣ−e²ˣ+1))+C"],"a":1,"i":"M25-0092"},{"t":"∫eᵗᵃⁿˣ(sinx−secx)dx, is equal to","s":"[I =∫eᵗᵃⁿˣ(sinx−secx)dx; =∫sinxeᵗᵃⁿˣdx−∫secxeᵗᵃⁿˣdx; =−eᵗᵃⁿˣcosx+∫cosxeᵗᵃⁿˣsec²xdx−∫secxeᵗᵃⁿˣdx; =−cosxeᵗᵃⁿˣ+C]","d":"M","p":"Integration by Parts","k":"Chapter Test","o":["eᵗᵃⁿˣcosx+C","eᵗᵃⁿˣsinx+C","−eᵗᵃⁿˣcosx+C","eᵗᵃⁿˣsecx+C"],"a":2,"i":"M25-0093"},{"t":"The ∫sin²x/cos⁶x dx is a is a polynomial of degree n in tanx, then n =","s":"Putting tan x=t, the given integral can be written as ∫t²(1+t²)dt=t³/3+t⁵/5+C=tan⁵x/5+tan³x/3+C which is a polynomial of degree 5 in tanx.","d":"M","p":"Integration by Substitution","k":"Chapter Test","o":["4","10","8","5"],"a":3,"i":"M25-0094"},{"t":"∫x/((x²+2x+2)²)dx is equal to","s":"[ Let, l=∫x/((x²+2x+2)²)dx; l=∫x/([(x+1)²+1]²)dx] Put x+1=tanθ [⇒ dx=sec²θdθ; l =∫((tanθ−1)sec²θ)/((tan²θ+1)²)dθ; =∫((tanθ−1)sec²θ)/sec⁴θdθ] [ =∫(tanθ/sec²θ−1/sec²θ)dθ; =∫(sinθcosθ−cos²θ)dθ; =1/2∫(2sinθcosθ−2cos²θ)dθ; =1/2∫(sin2θ−1−cos2θ)dθ; =1/2∫((−cos2θ)/2−θ−sin2θ/2)+C; =−1/4[cos2θ+sin^(2θ)]−1/2θ+C; =−1/4[(1−tan²θ)/(1−tan²θ)+2tanθ/(1+tanθ)]−1/2tan⁻¹(x+1)+C; =−1/4[(1−tan²θ+2tanθ)/(1+tan²θ)]−1/2tan⁻¹(x+1)+C; ∴l=−1/4[(x²−2)/(x²+2x+2)]−1/2tan⁻¹(x+1)+C]","d":"H","p":"Integration by Substitution","k":"Chapter Test","o":["(x²+2)/(x²+2x+2)−1/2tan⁻¹(x+1)+C","(x²+2)/(2(x²+2x+2))−1/2tan⁻¹(x−1)+C","(x²−2)/(4(x²+2x+2))−1/2tan⁻¹(x+1)+C","(2(x−1))/(x²+2x+2)+1/2tan⁻¹(x+1)+C"],"a":2,"i":"M25-0095"},{"t":"If ∫eˣ/((eˣ+7)(eˣ−8))dx=1/kln|(eˣ+a)/(eˣ+b)|+c, then value of (b−a)/k is (where c is the constant of integration)","s":"I=∫eˣ/((eˣ+7) (eˣ−8))dxPut eˣ=t ; eˣdx=dtI=∫dt/((t+7) (t−8))=∫[(−1)/(t+7)+1/(t−8)]1/15dt=1/15 ln|(eˣ−8)/(eˣ+7)|+cOn comparing, we get,a=−8, b=7, k=15i.e. (b−a)/k=1","d":"E","p":"Integration by Substitution","k":"Chapter Test","o":["4","1","8","5"],"a":1,"i":"M25-0096"},{"t":"∫x/(x⁴−1)dx is equal to","s":"LetI=∫x/(x⁴−1)dx⇒I=∫{x/((x²−1)(x²+1))}dx⇒I=1/2∫{2x/((x²−1)(x²+1))}dxPut x²=t⇒2xdx=dt∴I=1/2∫{1/((t−1)(t+1))}dt⇒I=1/4∫{((t+1)−(t−1))/((t−1)(t+1))}dt⇒I=1/4∫{1/(t−1)−1/(t+1)}dt⇒I=1/4[log|t−1|−log|t+1|]+C⇒I=1/4[log|(t−1)/(t+1)|]+C⇒I=1/4[log|(x²−1)/(x²+1)|]+C","d":"M","p":"Integration by Substitution","k":"Chapter Test","o":["1/4log[(x²−1)/(x²+1)]+C","1/4log[(x²+1)/(x²−1)]+C","1/2log[(x²−1)/(x²+1)]+C","1/2log[(x²+1)/(x²−1)]+C"],"a":0,"i":"M25-0097"},{"t":"If the integral ∫5tanx/(tanx−2)dx=x+alog|sinx−2cosx|+k, then a is equal to","s":"Let I=∫5tanx/(tanx−2)dx=∫5sinx/(sinx−2cosx)dx\nLet 5sinx=A(sinx−2cosx)+B(cosx+2sinx). Equating coefficients of sinx and cosx, we get 5=A+2B and 0=−2A+B⇒A=1,B=2","d":"H","p":"Integration by Substitution","k":"Chapter Test","o":["1","2","3","4"],"a":1,"i":"M25-0098"},{"t":"Let f(x)=∫xˢⁱⁿˣ(1+xcosx⋅lnx+sinx)dx and f(π/2)=π²/4, then the value of |cos(f(π))| is","s":"f(x)=∫xˢⁱⁿˣ(1+xcosx⋅lnx+sinx)dx\nif F(x)=xˢⁱⁿˣ=eˢⁱⁿˣˡⁿˣ\n[∴f(x)=∫(F(x)+xF^′(x))=xF(x)+C; f(x)=x⋅xˢⁱⁿˣ+C; f(π/2)=π/2⋅π/2+C ⇒ C=0; ∴f(x)=x(x)ˢⁱⁿˣ;f(π)=π(π)⁰=π]\ncos(π)=1\nso |cos(π)|=1","d":"H","p":"Miscellaneous Forms","k":"Chapter Test","n":"1","i":"M25-0099"},{"t":"If ∫(f(x))/(x²−x+1) dx=3/2log(x²−x+1)+ 1/√3tan⁻¹(2x−1)/√3+C then f(3) is equal to","s":"Differentiating both the sides w.r.t. x, we get","d":"M","p":"Miscellaneous Forms","k":"Chapter Test","n":"8","i":"M25-0100"},{"t":"If ∫(4eˣ+6e⁻ˣ)/(9eˣ−4e⁻ˣ) dx=Ax+Blog(9e²ˣ−4)+C then the least integer less than or equal to [B-A].. where [.] represents greatest integer","s":"Let I=∫(4eˣ+6e⁻ˣ)/(9eˣ−4e⁻ˣ)dx\n=∫(4e²ˣ+6)/(9e²ˣ−4)dx\nPut e²ˣ=t, so that\nI=∫(4t+6)/(9t−4)⋅1/2tdt\n\nAlternatively differentiate both the sides w.r.t. x, we get\n\nEquating the coefficients of eˣ and e⁻ˣ We get 4=9A+18B and 6=−4A\n⇒A=(−3)/2,B=35/36","d":"M","p":"Integration by Substitution","k":"Chapter Test","n":"2","i":"M25-0101"},{"t":"Let g(x)=∫(1+2cosx)/((cosx+2)²)dx and g(0)=0, then the value of 8g(π/2) is","s":"g(x)=∫(cosx(cosx+2)+sin²x)/((cosx+2)²)dx =∫cosx_(⏟) _(II) ⋅1/((cosx+2)²)_I_(⏟) _(I) dx+∫sin²x/((cosx+2)²)dx =1/(cosx+2)⋅sinx−∫sin²x/((cosx+2)²)dx+∫sin²x/((cosx+2)²)dx ∴g(x)=sinx/(cosx+2)+C ∴g(0)=0⇒C=0 ∴g(x)=sinx/(cosx+2)⇒g(π/2)=1/2 ⇒8×1/2=4","d":"H","p":"Integration by Parts","k":"Chapter Test","n":"4","i":"M25-0102"},{"t":"If ∫[(x/e)ˣ+(e/x)ˣ]lnxdx=A(x/e)ˣ+B(e/x)ˣ+C, then the value of A+B is","s":"∫[(x/e)ˣ+(e/x)ˣ]lnxdx\nput (x/e)ˣ=t\nor xln(x/e)=lnt\n∴(x⋅1/(x/e)⋅1/e+ln(x/e))dx=1/tdt\n∴(1+lnx−lne)dx=1/tdt\n∴(lne+lnx−lne)dx=1/tdt\n∴(lnx)dx=1/tdt\nor I=∫(t+1/t)1/tdt=∫1⋅dt+∫1/t²dt\n=t−1/t+C\nor I=(x/e)ˣ−(e/x)ˣ+C","d":"H","p":"Miscellaneous Forms","k":"Chapter Test","n":"0","i":"M25-0103"}]